    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\n1-Bedroom Apartment | Easra Court, Killester, Dublin 5\n\nModern, Light-Filled Living in a Premium New Development\n\nThis beautifully appointed 1-bedroom apartment is part of Easra Court, a brand-new rental development offering high-spec homes and exclusive resident facilities in the heart of Dublin 5.\n\nThis apartment features generous living space, a stylish kitchen, and a bright, airy atmosphere throughout.\n\nApartment Features:\n\n• Open-plan kitchen/living/dining area\n• Contemporary fitted kitchen with integrated appliances\n• Double bedroom with fitted wardrobes\n• Sleek, fully tiled bathroom\n• Ample storage and modern finishes\n• Wired for high-speed broadband\n\nExclusive Resident Amenities:\n• Co-Working Lounge with Wi-Fi and quiet working areas\n• Compact Gym for convenient workouts on-site\n• Landscaped Outdoor Courtyard for socialising or relaxing\n• Private Parking (subject to availability)\n• Bicycle Storage and Lift Access\n\nThis apartment is just a short walk from Killester DART Station, offering direct rail access to the city centre. Killester Village, St Anne's Park, and the Dublin coastline are all on your doorstep, with key business hubs including East Point and the IFSC just minutes away."
      },
